// ps_jpeg.logic - JPEG decoder (baseline, extended and progressive Huffman)
// and a baseline 4:2:0 encoder, both as sliced jobs.
//
// Decoding keeps every coefficient (Int16 per sample) until the scans are
// complete, then runs the IDCT and colour conversion in row slices. Photos
// larger than the document limit are decoded at 1/2, 1/4 or 1/8 size with a
// reduced IDCT, which is how a 12-megapixel camera file opens in seconds.

let PS_ZIGZAG = Int32Array.from([
  0, 1, 8, 16, 9, 2, 3, 10, 17, 24, 32, 25, 18, 11, 4, 5, 12, 19, 26, 33, 40, 48, 41, 34, 27, 20, 13, 6, 7, 14, 21, 28,
  35, 42, 49, 56, 57, 50, 43, 36, 29, 22, 15, 23, 30, 37, 44, 51, 58, 59, 52, 45, 38, 31, 39, 46, 53, 60, 61, 54, 47, 55, 62, 63]);

